README.md:1:# Mini Template
README.md:2:
README.md:3:A dependency-free TypeScript template renderer for Bun.
README.md:4:
README.md:5:```ts
README.md:6:import { render } from "./src/engine";
README.md:7:
README.md:8:render("Hello, {{name}}!", { name: "Ada & Bob" });
README.md:9:// "Hello, Ada &amp; Bob!"
README.md:10:```
README.md:11:
README.md:12:Supported tags:
README.md:13:
README.md:14:- `{{path.to.value}}` — HTML-escaped interpolation
README.md:15:- `{{{path.to.value}}}` — unescaped interpolation
README.md:16:- `{{#if path}}...{{else}}...{{/if}}` — conditional block
README.md:17:- `{{#each path}}...{{else}}...{{/each}}` — array iteration with `{{this}}` and `{{@index}}`
README.md:18:- `{{! comment }}` — comment
README.md:19:
README.md:20:Blocks can be nested. Within an `each`, paths first look at the current item and enclosing items, then the root data.
README.md:21:
README.md:22:## CLI
README.md:23:
README.md:24:```sh
README.md:25:bun run src/cli.ts template.txt data.json
README.md:26:```
README.md:27:
README.md:28:Rendered text is written to stdout. File, JSON, template, and usage errors are written to stderr and return a non-zero status.
README.md:29:
